('wikiloc', '5307512', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/sta-ma-meia-cami-ramader-tossal-de-mirapallars-i-urgell-tossal-de-les-torretes-cingles-de-cabroa-5307512', 'Sta Ma. Meià-Cattle Trail-Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell-Tossal de les Torretes-Cingles de Cabroa', '{"en":"Circular via Mirapallars and Cabroa cliffs","ca":"Circular per Mirapallars i Cingles de Cabroa","es":"Circular por Mirapallars y Cingles de Cabroa"}'::jsonb, 'Sta Ma. Meià-Camí Ramader-Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell-Tossal de les Torretes-Cingles de Cabroa Hiking trail in Santa Maria de Meià, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Caminada molt interessant que et portarà als dos cims més importants del Montsec de Rubies,el Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell i el Tossal de les Torretes, 
des d''on gaudiràs d''unes vistes extraordinaries del Pirineu,el Cadí,Montserrat, 
el Pedraforca i un llarc etc. de cims. 
El camí no te cap mena de dificultat,sols s''ha d''anar en compte baixant el pas 
o grau del Reguer, aquest tram ès mal marcat i relliscós ,hi ha molta pedra solta.', '{"en":"This interesting loop trail from Santa Maria de Meià guides you to the two most important peaks of Montsec de Rubies: Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell and Tossal de les Torretes. From these summits, you''ll enjoy extraordinary panoramic views of the Pyrenees, Cadí, Montserrat, and Pedraforca.\n\nThe 18.9 km route with 1045 m of elevation gain has no major technical difficulties, but caution is advised on the descent of Pas o Grau del Reguer. This section is poorly marked and can be slippery due to loose stones.\n\nOverall, it''s a rewarding moderate hike for those seeking expansive vistas and a good physical challenge.","ca":"Aquesta interessant ruta circular des de Santa Maria de Meià us guiarà als dos cims més importants del Montsec de Rúbies: el Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell i el Tossal de les Torretes. Des d''aquests cims, gaudireu de vistes panoràmiques extraordinàries del Pirineu, el Cadí, Montserrat i el Pedraforca.\n\nLa ruta de 18,9 km amb 1045 m de desnivell no presenta grans dificultats tècniques, però es recomana precaució en el descens del Pas o Grau del Reguer. Aquest tram està mal senyalitzat i pot ser relliscós a causa de la pedra solta.\n\nEn general, és una caminada moderada gratificant per a aquells que busquen vistes àmplies i un bon repte físic.","es":"Esta interesante ruta circular desde Santa Maria de Meià le guiará a las dos cumbres más importantes del Montsec de Rúbies: el Tossal de Mirapallars i Urgell y el Tossal de les Torretes. Desde estas cumbres, disfrutará de vistas panorámicas extraordinarias del Pirineo, el Cadí, Montserrat y el Pedraforca.\n\nLa ruta de 18,9 km con 1045 m de desnivel no presenta grandes dificultades técnicas, pero se recomienda precaución en el descenso del Pas o Grau del Reguer. Este tramo está mal señalizado y puede ser resbaladizo debido a la piedra suelta.\n\nEn general, es una caminata moderada gratificante para aquellos que buscan vistas amplias y un buen reto físico."}'::jsonb, 'enric Costa', 18926, 1045, 1045, 1669, 728, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 28020, 2050, '2013-09-22', '2013-08', '[{"lat":41.995036,"lng":0.989522,"ele":729.9},{"lat":41.994976,"lng":0.989438,"ele":728.7},{"lat":41.994969,"lng":0.989422,"ele":728.5},{"lat":41.99495,"lng":0.989414,"ele":728.3},{"lat":41.99497,"lng":0.989409,"ele":728.4},{"lat":41.994987,"lng":0.989411,"ele":728.6},{"lat":41.995106,"lng":0.989434,"ele":730.8},{"lat":41.995225,"lng":0.989349,"ele":732.4},{"lat":41.995248,"lng":0.989338,"ele":732.7},{"lat":41.995279,"lng":0.989322,"ele":733.1},{"lat":41.995414,"lng":0.989264,"ele":735.5},{"lat":41.995546,"lng":0.989187,"ele":737.9},{"lat":41.995527,"lng":0.989247,"ele":737.7},{"lat":41.995548,"lng":0.989231,"ele":738.1},{"lat":41.995705,"lng":0.989315,"ele":740.4},{"lat":41.995837,"lng":0.989309,"ele":742.1},{"lat":41.995952,"lng":0.989312,"ele":744.2},{"lat":41.995962,"lng":0.989311,"ele":744.3},{"lat":41.996063,"lng":0.989399,"ele":746.3},{"lat":41.99608,"lng":0.989452,"ele":746.6},{"lat":41.996069,"lng":0.989584,"ele":747.4},{"lat":41.996011,"lng":0.989723,"ele":747.6},{"lat":41.995922,"lng":0.989819,"ele":747.3},{"lat":41.995901,"lng":0.989832,"ele":747.2},{"lat":41.995888,"lng":0.989851,"ele":747.2},{"lat":41.995788,"lng":0.990016,"ele":747.4},{"lat":41.995741,"lng":0.990113,"ele":747.7},{"lat":41.99571,"lng":0.990204,"ele":748.1},{"lat":41.995669,"lng":0.990313,"ele":748.2},{"lat":41.995674,"lng":0.990326,"ele":748.4},{"lat":41.995711,"lng":0.990442,"ele":750.4},{"lat":41.995768,"lng":0.990443,"ele":751.7},{"lat":41.995819,"lng":0.990358,"ele":752.2},{"lat":41.995882,"lng":0.990287,"ele":752.8},{"lat":41.996046,"lng":0.990175,"ele":753.6},{"lat":41.996096,"lng":0.990162,"ele":754.1},{"lat":41.996147,"lng":0.990145,"ele":754.3},{"lat":41.996214,"lng":0.990144,"ele":754.8},{"lat":41.996281,"lng":0.990139,"ele":755.2},{"lat":41.996335,"lng":0.99014,"ele":755.6},{"lat":41.996382,"lng":0.990147,