https://es.wikiloc.com/rutas-senderismo/c2-tuc-del-rosari-de-baciver-coll-dairoto-56007284', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route starts at Refugi d''Airoto and ascends three summits: Tuc Oriental de Marimanya (2671m), Tuc de Marimanya (2679m), and Pic de Rosari de Baciver (2617m).\n\nThe initial section to Estany Mitjà d''Airoto involves navigating stone blocks, followed by an unmarked but clear path to Collada dels Plans. From there, the route continues north through the Plans d''Isavarre, crossing several small lakes, with some route-finding needed to reach Coll d''Airoto.\n\nAfter traversing the ridge to the three Marimanya summits, the route returns to Coll d''Airoto before heading east to Tuc de Bonabé (2723m). This ascent involves scrambling over blocks. The descent from Coll d''Airoto passes Estany d''Airoto and connects with a well-marked trail down to Isil, ending near the C-147 road.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta lineal comença al Refugi d''Airoto i ascendeix tres cims: Tuc Oriental de Marimanya (2671m), Tuc de Marimanya (2679m) i Pic de Rosari de Baciver (2617m).\n\nEl tram inicial cap a l''Estany Mitjà d''Airoto implica travessar blocs de pedra, seguit d''un sender sense marcar però evident fins a la Collada dels Plans. Des d''allí, la ruta continua cap al nord pels Plans d''Isavarre, creuant diversos estanys petits, amb certa orientació necessària per arribar al Coll d''Airoto.\n\nDesprés de recórrer la carena fins als tres cims de Marimanya, la ruta torna al Coll d''Airoto abans de dirigir-se a l''est cap al Tuc de Bonabé (2723m). Aquesta pujada implica grimpades sobre blocs. El descens des del Coll d''Airoto passa per l''Estany d''Airoto i connecta amb un corriol ben marcat que baixa fins a Isil, acabant prop de la carretera C-147.","es":"Esta exigente ruta lineal comienza en el Refugi d''Airoto y asciende tres cumbres: Tuc Oriental de Marimanya (2671m), Tuc de Marimanya (2679m) y Pic de Rosari de Baciver (2617m).\n\nEl tramo inicial hacia el Estany Mitjà d''Airoto implica atravesar bloques de piedra, seguido de un sendero sin marcar pero evidente hasta la Collada dels Plans. Desde allí, la ruta continúa hacia el norte por los Plans d''Isavarre, cruzando varios pequeños lagos, con cierta orientación necesaria para llegar al Coll d''Airoto.\n\nDespués de recorrer la cresta hasta las tres cumbres de Marimanya, la ruta regresa al Coll d''Airoto antes de dirigirse al este hacia el Tuc de Bonabé (2723m). Esta subida implica trepadas sobre bloques. El descenso desde el Coll d''Airoto pasa por el Estany d''Airoto y conecta con un sendero bien marcado que baja hasta Isil, terminando cerca de la carretera C-147."}'::jsonb, 'lidiasojo', 16480, 1097, 2039, 2709, 1209, 'difficult', 'one-way', NULL, NULL, 2747, '2020-08-27', '2020-07', '[{"lat":42.696701,"lng":1.041982,"ele":2206.2},{"lat":42.696716,"lng":1.041904,"ele":2205.7},{"lat":42.696721,"lng":1.041732,"ele":2204.3},{"lat":42.696744,"lng":1.041518,"ele":2202.4},{"lat":42.69672,"lng":1.041088,"ele":2197.5},{"lat":42.696674,"lng":1.040561,"ele":2189.9},{"lat":42.696583,"lng":1.040221,"ele":2182.7},{"lat":42.696628,"lng":1.03926,"ele":2178.6},{"lat":42.696547,"lng":1.038107,"ele":2134.5},{"lat":42.69654,"lng":1.038105,"ele":2134.6},{"lat":42.696502,"lng":1.037992,"ele":2137.3},{"lat":42.696532,"lng":1.037873,"ele":2138.5},{"lat":42.696578,"lng":1.037768,"ele":2139.5},{"lat":42.69664,"lng":1.037678,"ele":2140.8},{"lat":42.69668,"lng":1.03761,"ele":2141.8},{"lat":42.696685,"lng":1.037607,"ele":2141.8},{"lat":42.696693,"lng":1.037545,"ele":2143.3},{"lat":42.696692,"lng":1.037542,"ele":2143.3},{"lat":42.696692,"lng":1.03754,"ele":2143.5},{"lat":42.696695,"lng":1.037538,"ele":2143.6},{"lat":42.696697,"lng":1.037552,"ele":2144},{"lat":42.696698,"lng":1.037553,"ele":2144.1},{"lat":42.696697,"lng":1.037548,"ele":2144.3},{"lat":42.696697,"lng":1.037545,"ele":2144.5},{"lat":42.696702,"lng":1.037547,"ele":2145.1},{"lat":42.696703,"lng":1.037537,"ele":2145.1},{"lat":42.69671,"lng":